cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use arabnamer in your research or product, please cite it as below."
title: "arabnamer: Arabic name transliteration and similarity"
abstract: >
  arabnamer is a Python library for English-to-Arabic name transliteration and
  Arabic-to-Arabic fuzzy name similarity. It bundles an XGBoost model pruned to
  386 boosting rounds (38 MB gzipped) trained on 22,798 English-Arabic name
  pairs sourced from JRC-Names, Google Translate, LLM fill-in, and manual
  audit. Lenient-scoring accuracy is 98.4 on a 25-name MENA benchmark.
